title: Projects

To create a project, simply create a tiddle and tag it
with `project`.

!! Issues

To get a list of all issues attached to a specific `project`, use the macro

```
<<project-issues "project">>
```

By default, completed issues will not be shown.
If you want to see all issues, use the `show` parameter which can take
the following values:

* `all`, show all issues
* `closed` show only closed issues
* `open` show only open issues

For instance

```
<<project-issues "DevThing core" "closed">>
```

results in

<<project-issues "DevThing core" "closed">>

As an example, see [[DevThing core]].

!! Timeline

The timeline macro allows to list all the issues relating to a specific
project. For instance,

```
<<project-issues-timeline "DevThing core">>
```

will render

<<project-issues-timeline "DevThing core">>